@startuml SD-07
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-07 / UC-07 - View own reservations
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Customer as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Request own reservation list or selected reference
alt no customer identity or selected record belongs to another customer
system --> actor: Reject without revealing another customer's record
else current customer identity
note right of system
Filter by current owner before returning
lists or details. Use saved quantities,
prices, amounts and statuses.
end note
alt owned records found
system --> actor: Show own records; expose cancellation only for Pending\ncollection
else owned list empty
system --> actor: Show no-reservations message
else selected reference missing or read fails
system --> actor: Show not-found or read error; no data changes
end
end
note right of system
Read-only goal. Selecting cancellation starts
UC-05; opening or refreshing the list does
not cancel anything.
end note
@enduml
